  sentences:
    nameNPC: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng 2"
    Lines:
    - "\u0110inh Ho\xE0n, nh\xECn th\u1EA5y \xE1nh \u0111u\u1ED1c v\xE0 s\u1EE3i
      d\xE2y, b\u01A1i h\u1EBFt s\u1EE9c b\xECnh sinh, n\u1EAFm l\u1EA5y s\u1EE3i
